@sikorski_freeze_2026
# prose-audit: Grade A — The freeze is still correctly distinguished from repeal, and the three responses now differ in what they establish: a deliberately unchaired council with a shared calendar, filings that prove a ministry is acting outside the law, or a February deployment the Interior Ministry would otherwise have had to invent in April.
