= December 2026 — First, make the laws stop working

Finance Minister <span class="party-konf"><b>Sławomir Mentzen</b></span> blocks implementation funds. Economy
Minister **Przemysław Wipler** orders a review of labour-inspection powers.
The equality administration stops issuing new guidance, while hospitals are
told that reproductive-rights regulations are under legal reconsideration.

No statute has yet been repealed. That distinction matters to courts and to the
President, but less to the people whose appointments, inspections and clinical
decisions have already stalled. Union pickets, equality vigils and a revived
Women's Strike begin on separate calendars. Interior Ministry vans and police
barriers appear before the crowds have agreed on a common name.

- @sikorski_freeze_movements_2026
- @sikorski_freeze_courts_2026
